{
  "note": "Issue #98 列挙項目ごとのカバレッジ台帳。kind: e2e=run行列で観測 / existing-test=既存テスト / guard-test=本 Issue で追加した最小ガード / unmeasured=実測未実施(理由付き)。golden 面は contracts.json の分類に従う。",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "decode.wav_pcm_values",
      "target": "Decode: WAV の元 PCM 値・format",
      "kind": "e2e+existing-test",
      "evidence": [
        "runs:canonical",
        "runs:small",
        "crates/al-media/tests/ingest.rs",
        "crates/al-media/tests/golden.rs"
      ],
      "golden": [
        "inputs\\IN-*/metadata.json(format/sample_format/channels)",
        "analysis/inputs/IN-*.wav(bit-exact)",
        "analysis/inputs/IN-*.metadata.json"
      ],
      "note": "source-bgm.wav 等の WAV 入力の decode 済み PCM は inputs\\IN-*/decoded.f64le(tolerance) と analysis/inputs/IN-*.wav(bit-exact) で保持"
    },
    {
      "id": "decode.avi_mp4_aac_fallback",
      "target": "Decode: AVI/MP4 と AAC fallback",
      "kind": "e2e+existing-test",
      "evidence": [
        "runs:canonical",
        "runs:variant-*",
        "crates/al-media/tests/mp4.rs",
        "crates/al-media/tests/aac.rs"
      ],
      "golden": [
        "inputs\\IN-*/metadata.json(decoder.streams/codec)",
        "inputs\\IN-*/video_features.json"
      ],
      "note": "派生 AVI(PCM 音声)と MP4/AAC 元素材双方を ingest で網羅。AAC fallback 判定は metadata.json の decoder 情報で観測"
    },
    {
      "id": "decode.pts_timebase_vfr",
      "target": "Decode: PTS/timebase, VFR",
      "kind": "e2e+existing-test",
      "evidence": [
        "runs:canonical",
        "runs:variant-*",
        "crates/al-media/tests/mp4.rs",
        "crates/al-media/tests/golden.rs"
      ],
      "golden": [
        "inputs\\IN-*/metadata.json(av_timing/streams)",
        "inputs\\IN-*/video_features.json(pts/timebase)"
      ],
      "note": "派生 AVI は CFR 10fps 化されるため VFR 観測は元 MP4 を用いた既存 mp4 テストに委譲"
    },
    {
      "id": "decode.multitrack",
      "target": "Decode: multitrack",
      "kind": "existing-test",
      "evidence": ["crates/al-media/tests/mp4.rs", "crates/al-media/tests/fixtures"],
      "note": "multitrack 素材は al-media テストのフィクスチャで網羅。e2e 実サンプルは単一音声トラック"
    },
    {
      "id": "decode.missing_discontinuous",
      "target": "Decode: 欠落/不連続の素材",
      "kind": "e2e+existing-test",
      "evidence": [
        "runs:canonical(dropout)",
        "crates/al-media/tests/ingest.rs",
        "crates/al-media/tests/golden.rs"
      ],
      "golden": [
        "inputs\\IN-1/metadata.json(gap/drop 情報)",
        "locate/*/time_map.json(discontinuity)"
      ],
      "note": "dropout.avi は音切り素材。不連続は locate の time_map/result で観測"
    },
    {
